    "longDescription": "Haoone 字幕工作流插件，为 Codex 提供完整的字幕处理能力。基于 qwen3-asr 本地模型，支持单文件/批量转录、文稿匹配与格式化、热词管理、项目创建与管理、翻译与双语字幕等功能。需要安装 Haoone 桌面端并启动 CLI。",
    "developerName": "haoone",
    "category": "Productivity",
    "capabilities": [
      "Interactive",
      "Write"
    ],
    "websiteURL": "https://www.haoai.pro/haoone",
    "privacyPolicyURL": "https://www.haoai.pro/haoone/privacy",
    "termsOfServiceURL": "https://www.haoai.pro/haoone/terms",
    "defaultPrompt": [
      "/haoone transcribe /path/to/media.mp4",
      "/haoone batch-transcribe /path/to/a.mp3,/path/to/b.mp4",
      "帮我把这个视频转成字幕"
    ],
    "brandColor": "#4f46e5",
    "composerIcon": "./assets/icon.svg",
    "logo": "./assets/logo.svg"
